---
import ProseLayout from '@/layouts/ProseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '@/config/site';

const updated = '12 October 2026';
---

<ProseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How More Bums on Seats collects, uses and protects the personal data you share through our website."
  eyebrow="Privacy Policy"
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  lead={`Last updated: ${updated}`}
>
  <p>
    This policy explains how {site.name} (“we”, “us”) handles personal data collected through
    {site.url.replace('https://', '')}. We keep it short because we collect very little.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Details you submit through our contact form: name, email, venue name, venue type and message.</li>
    <li>Your email address if you subscribe to our newsletter.</li>
    <li>Basic, anonymised technical data needed to serve and secure the website.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <p>
    We use your details only to respond to your enquiry, provide the services you request and — if you
    subscribed — send our newsletter. We never sell your data.
  </p>

  <h2>Legal basis &amp; retention</h2>
  <p>
    We process enquiries on the basis of your consent and our legitimate interest in replying to you. We
    keep enquiry data for as long as needed to handle your request and any resulting working relationship.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask to access, correct or delete your data, or withdraw consent at any time, by emailing
    <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a>. Every newsletter includes an
    unsubscribe link.
  </p>

  <h2>Third parties</h2>
  <p>
    The website is hosted on Cloudflare Pages, and images are served by Unsplash. Form submissions are
    delivered to our inbox by email using FormSubmit. These providers may process technical data such as
    IP addresses to deliver content securely.
  </p>
</ProseLayout>
